    "faq": {
      "type": "ca-faq-list",
      "blocks": {
        "item_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do we own the app?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Custom apps are built as your own Shopify app, installed on your store, with the code and the Partner Dashboard app in your name. We host and maintain it under a retainer, or hand it to your team.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it break when Shopify updates?",
            "answer": "<p>We build on Shopify's versioned Admin and Storefront APIs and keep the app on a supported version. API deprecations are handled as part of support, before they become a problem.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you integrate with our ERP or warehouse?",
            "answer": "<p>That is most of what we do: ERPs including NetSuite, 3PLs and warehouse systems, freight carriers, distributor inventory feeds. If it has an API or a file export, we can sync it, two ways where it matters.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How is this different from your public apps?",
            "answer": "<p>Our public apps (Wholesale, Wishlist, Draft Order Invoices, Bonde) solve common problems for hundreds of stores. Custom work is for the problem only your business has. Often the answer is a public app plus a small custom piece, and we will tell you when that is the cheaper route.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
